---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Wildlife Rehabilitation and Conservation">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section style="background: #B5A090; min-height: 90vh; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; overflow: hidden;">
    <div style="padding: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem) clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem);">
      <h1 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 5vw, 4.5rem); font-weight: 300; color: var(--color-text); line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
        Protecting native species.
      </h1>
      <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 480px;">
        Southeastern Reptile Conservation is a Virginia-based nonprofit dedicated to the
        conservation, rehabilitation, and protection of native reptiles and amphibians.
        We provide permitted wildlife rehabilitation with the goal of returning animals
        to the wild, while supporting habitat stewardship, public education, and
        conservation-focused technology.
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--color-text-muted); font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        We can't do this without your support.
      </p>
      <a href="/about" class="btn btn--outline">
        Learn more
      </a>
    </div>
    <div style="height: 100%; min-height: 90vh; overflow: hidden;">
      <img
        src="/images/hero-turtle.jpg"
        alt="Eastern box turtle in natural habitat"
        style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mission strip -->
  <section style="background: var(--color-surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); padding: 3rem var(--site-gutter);">
    <div style="max-width: var(--site-max); margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 3rem; text-align: center;">
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Rehabilitation</div>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Caring for injured and orphaned native reptiles and amphibians with licensed expertise.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Conservation</div>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Protecting habitats and advocating for species of greatest conservation concern in Virginia.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Education</div>
        <p style="font-size: 14px; color: var(--color-text-muted); line-height: 1.6;">Building community awareness and using technology to advance conservation outcomes.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Latest from the blog -->
  <section style="padding: 5rem var(--site-gutter); max-width: var(--site-max); margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; margin-bottom: 2.5rem; padding-bottom: 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);">
      <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: 2.2rem; font-weight: 300;">From the blog</h2>
      <a href="/blog" style="font-size: 13px; text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; color: var(--color-text-muted);">All posts</a>
    </div>
    <a href="/blog/ai-in-wildlife-rehabilitation" class="post-card" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 3rem; text-decoration: none; color: inherit;">
      <div>
        <div class="post-card__date">April 2026</div>
        <div class="post-card__title">AI in wildlife rehabilitation: from paper notes to life-saving insights</div>
        <p class="post-card__excerpt">How we used Claude, Anthropic's AI assistant, to turn handwritten field notes into a working spreadsheet, catch a data error, and surface insights that were invisible on paper.</p>
        <span class="post-card__read-more">Read more</span>
      </div>
      <div class="post-card__image" style="aspect-ratio: 4/3; overflow: hidden;">
        <img src="/images/hatchling-rock.jpg" alt="Diamondback terrapin hatchling" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover;" />
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>

  <!-- Donate CTA -->
  <section style="background: var(--color-bg-dark); padding: 5rem var(--site-gutter); text-align: center;">
    <h2 style="font-family: var(--font-serif); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 300; color: #F5F2EC; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
      Support native wildlife rehabilitation
    </h2>
    <p style="color: #9A9080; max-width: 520px; margin: 0 auto 2rem; line-height: 1.75; font-size: 1rem;">
      SERC is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit. Your donation directly supports the care of
      injured and orphaned reptiles and amphibians in Virginia.
    </p>
    <a href="https://linktr.ee/turtlerehab" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn btn--outline" style="border-color: #D5D0C8; color: #D5D0C8;">
      Donate
    </a>
  </section>

</Layout>
